 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published. The title credits 'Martin/Maarten' (the post is signed by Martin Akesson; Maarten is his partner, not otherwise named); credited to Martin Akesson.",
  "The starting Effect depends on the matchup (Battle Order, Bad Feeling Have I, Oppressive Enforcement or Crush The Rebellion per the strategy), so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Posted 'forrest', 'jungle', 'swamp' and 'space port dockin bay' dested the Special Edition Dark generic sites Forest, Jungle, Swamp and Spaceport Docking Bay; 'meditation chamber' Executor: Meditation Chamber; 'ice plains' / 'wampa cave' the Hoth sites; 'dagobah cave' Dagobah: Cave.",
  "Posted 'AT-ST pilot X4' dested 4 AT-ST Pilot; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Omni Box' Ommni Box; 'there be hell to pay X2' There'll Be Hell To Pay; 'Boba Fett in Slave 1' Boba Fett In Slave I.",
  "Battle Order and Oppressive Enforcement are the older Effects (no Defensive Shields existed in early 2000). AT-ST Pilot, Lieutenant Arnet and Battle Order are Endor-set cards, kept as posted."
 ],
 "player_note": "The description calls it a 'Post EJP raltiir deck used in worlds by us', and the author says 'Me and Maarten did really good with it in our regionals, in worlds and after'; this list is an update with Enhanced Jabba's Palace cards of a deck he had posted a few weeks earlier, so it may differ from what was played at Worlds.",
